旦有功，匹磾獨收之矣。」涉復辰等以為然，引軍而還。匹磾亦止。會疾陸眷病死，匹磾自薊奔喪，至於右北平。末杯宣言匹磾將篡，出軍擊敗之。末杯遂害涉復辰及其子弟黨與二百餘人，自立為單于。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003:m0021"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p001:m0104","surface":"涉復辰","start":104,"end":107,"person_id":"5lu_7mn_3wo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003:m0021","surface":"涉復辰","start":21,"end":24,"person_id":"5lu_7mn_3wo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003:m0092","surface":"涉復辰","start":92,"end":95,"person_id":"5lu_7mn_3wo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003:m0125","surface":"涉復辰","start":125,"end":128,"person_id":"5lu_7mn_3wo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003:m0182","surface":"涉復辰","start":182,"end":185,"person_id":"5lu_7mn_3wo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin063-duanchen-brother","subject_person_id":"5lu_7mn_3wo","object_person_id":"smo_e2h_sw9","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"務勿塵死，弟涉復辰"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-063","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi","source_id":"s-jinshu-063-duanpidi-ws2025242","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-duanpidi:p001","quote":"段匹磾，東部鮮卑人也。種類勁健，世為大人。父務勿塵，遣軍助東海王越征討有功，王浚表為親晉王，封遼西公，嫁女與務勿塵，以結鄰援。懷帝即位，以務勿塵為大單于，匹磾為左賢王，率眾助國征討，假撫軍大將軍。務勿塵死，弟涉復辰以務勿塵子疾陸眷襲號。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu